WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.853
Burukina Faso worodugu ni tileben fan fɛ, Lobo jamana na, kogojan dɔw lɔra ni kabakuru ye yiriw cɛmancɛ la, Loropeni dugu gɛrɛfɛ.

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:17.887
U tun lɔra ni kabakuru barikamanw ye ani yɔrɔ tun ka jan, nka sisan yɔrɔ si tɛ yen.

00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:20.091
O ye Loropeni ka tomow ye.

00:00:20.171 --> 00:00:27.380
O yɔrɔ minw bɛɛ kɛra UNESCO ka yɔrɔ barikamanw ye, o kɛra Burkina Faso jamana fɔlɔ ye.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:32.126
Ka fara o kan, u ye kabakuru barikaman dɔw lɔ o yɔrɔ la.

00:00:32.206 --> 00:00:34.668
Nka, jɔn lo y'u lɔ ani mun na?

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:37.211
O lo b'a to siranya be daminɛ.

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:45.178
Lɔnnikɛla dɔw y'a fɔ ko loon min na u faaw sera o yɔrɔ la, Lɔbi mɔgɔw tun y'o kogow lɔ ka ban.

00:00:45.258 --> 00:00:51.873
Lɔnnikɛlaw ni sɛgɛsɛgɛrikɛlaw be miiriyaw caaman na, nka u m'o bɛɛ faamu ka ɲɛ.

00:00:51.953 --> 00:01:03.230
Tuma caaman na, an be se k'a fɔ ko sanu tun ka ca o mara la ani ko u tun b'o yɔrɔ la sabu sannifeere tun be kɛ Afiriki tileben fan fɛ.

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:08.145
O kogow tun be se ka jagokow, mɔgɔ dɔw wala masaw latanga.

00:01:08.225 --> 00:01:15.604
Sisan, sɛgɛsɛgɛrikɛlaw tɛ se k'a fɔ k'o yɔrɔ lɔra saan jumɛn ani a lɔbagaw ye jɔn lo ye.

00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:31.876
O yɔrɔ minw tun cɛnna, i n'a fɔ o yɔrɔ kɔrɔw tun be cogo min na, o yɔrɔ bɛɛ la, mɔgɔ dɔw tun be to k'a lakali ko mɔgɔ minw tun siginin be kogo kɔfɛ ani u tun be minw kɔrɔsi, olu ka koo kofɔra.

00:01:31.956 --> 00:01:34.249
Loropeni ka kabakuruw be je.

00:01:34.329 --> 00:01:38.487
Nka, u be ɲiningaliw kɛ mɔgɔ o mɔgɔ nana bɔ an ye.

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:49.420
U b'an hakili jigi ko Afiriki tileben fan fɛ mɔgɔw ka maana ka kɔrɔ ani u ka nafolo ka bon ka tɛmɛ an ka miiriya kan tuma dɔw la.
